ty runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November was 56% of normal and November to December was 53%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
